(
    title: "Canyon Bomber",
    description: Some("Your bomber criss-crosses a canyon stacked with eight layers of bricks, dropping bombs on each pass — deeper layers score more, cleared canyons refill, and six wasted runs end the game short of the 1,000-point goal. Sea Bomber variations swap the canyon for ships at five depths, worth more the deeper they sail, with the knob setting how deep each charge explodes."),
